{"version":1,"content":"<p>加密貨幣交易所幣安（Binance）周二（3日）公布初步調查，指黑客利用假求職面試、惡意軟件及內部人工智能（AI）工具，分階段入侵系統，於上周四（10月29日）盜走63億美元（約491.4億港元）加密貨幣。</p><p>彭博社稱，這是數碼資產史上最大宗黑客盜竊案。</p><p>幣安及美國聯邦調查局（FBI）將案件歸咎朝鮮黑客，朝鮮否認。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:41:03.153335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:09:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:24.778937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:18.575933+00:00","content_hash":"eae56f2a732e593de818a99fc41a7c2ed903124ae72bb4b6a689ee9e7d302d10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}